{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善喜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法集經、大毗盧經、入印法門經、方等王經、心印經、興顯經、\n圓覺經、佛地經，更有餘本在別卷中，不錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論自反破初義云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聚即多也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
